<urn:sc-runtime:finding:RSH-PROD-001> qa:id "RSH-PROD-001" ;
 qa:severity "important" ; qa:status "fixed" ;
 qa:sprint "phase-b-production-readiness" ;
 qa:file "crates/sc-cron/src/hook.rs" ; qa:line 624 ;
 qa:alsoFile "crates/sc-cron/src/monty_run.rs:111-115" ;
 qa:reviewCommit "1e6931bed0130d8452a35a9a6ec17b30ace11302" ;
 qa:reviewerTask "/root/production_qa1_service" ; qa:requirement "NFR-CRON-0002" ; qa:adr "ADR-RUN-0016" ;
 qa:summary "Built-in unknown-action Debug formatting escapes resolved environment values before raw substring redaction, leaking reversible escaped values through persisted HOST_REPLY errors and terminal diagnostics." ;
 qa:evidence "Exact extracted redaction/parser std-only witness confirms synthetic newline/tab/backslash/quote values are not redacted in either adapter; production worker persistence and terminal event paths traced. Not represented as full scheduler execution." ;
 qa:remediation "Use fixed value-free unknown-action error listing accepted action names in both Python and Monty parsers, with secret-bearing malformed-reply regressions; no generalized escaped-secret transformation framework." .

